  "qualification_limits": [
    "Only history_records5000 and history_lines10000 default numerical enforcement are recommended. Already accepted history_line_bytes stays unchanged; other4historylimits, allotherlimits/definitions/keys/areas remain unchanged.",
    "Eight finite completeLF-terminated ASCII recipes, five record and three rawline controls perengine; not all-input,CRLF/EOF/malformedUnicode/filesystemrace/cancellation/storage/resource/full-reader qualification.",
    "Passing tests compare complete returned records with the existing guarded integer/f64 comparator, preserving array order, keys and value types. They assert selected summary fields, full coverage/defaults and file identities; they do not assert full-summary equality. Retained markers are compact observations, not full CLI report capture; numeric spelling, property order and path byte identity remain separate.",
